<title>ZIMBABWE: ZIMBABWE M3 MONEY SUPPLY RISES 23.91 PCT IN JAN.</title>
<headline>ZIMBABWE M3 MONEY SUPPLY RISES 23.91 PCT IN JAN.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's year-on-year broadly defined M3 money supply grew 23.91 percent in January after a rise of 31.02 percent in December, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>				    Jan 1997    Dec 1996    Jan 1996</p>
<p>M3 (Z$ million)		 21,580.9    22,227.8    17,416.8</p>
<p>M2     &quot;			  19,524.2    21,069.4    16,410.3</p>
<p>M1     &quot;			  12,606.0    13,750.9    11,184.7</p>
<p>--Harare Newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9--</p>
</text>
